      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your perception of prolonging suffering rather than curing it comes from a deep place of compassion you will never be able to give anyone else because you have too much work to do as a doctor to see the world as you see it. The \"noise\" you hear is likely just the sound of your own ethical integrity clashing against the broken limitations of the system around you. Please let this weight sit on your shoulders again so you can rest your feet and remember that you are not defined by the futility you witness but by your relentless refusal to stop caring.",
